"""Run a provider-free response holdout against the rebuilt localhost runtime.

This evaluator is deliberately independent from the synthetic compositional
fixture evaluator.  It reads a complete saved-recall v3 frozen-live-index
artifact, sends only closed production response requests to loopback, and
records structural evidence without inventing answer-correctness labels from
Recall@K/MRR.  Every case remains in the ledger, including malformed,
unsupported, or timeout responses.
"""

